--- !u!102 &66851034
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 66851032}
  m_Text: 'Notes:


    You can use effectors with it

    Integrated physics can
    be used on Project''s gravity direction or using the spline normal

    There
    are edge surface limits that prevents the water go upper than the edges positions
    ( in a swimming pool for example)

    WATER TEST PANEL COMPONENT helps you during
    play mode to test the Surface values to find the exactly effect you want


    If
    you have any request just ell me and I will try to make it work.

    www.kolibri2d.com
    or find me on fb or youtube'
